  {"q":"Can it convert scanned PDFs to Excel?","a":"Yes. Free OCR reads scanned or photographed pages in 12 languages and rebuilds the table rows and columns."},
  {"q":"Is PDF to Excel free?","a":"Yes, completely – including OCR, which some services charge for."},
  {"q":"Are my bank statements uploaded?","a":"No. Everything is processed in your browser; nothing is sent to a server."},
  {"q":"Will numbers be real numbers in Excel?","a":"Yes. Values with separators, currency symbols, percentages and bracketed negatives are stored as numeric cells."},
